cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Same Score, Different Context: Call-Graph Errors, Retrieval Stability, and What Gemma 4 Does With Them"
message: "If you use this protocol, call tracer or evaluation harness, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shafin
    given-names: Ahnaf
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered study of how call-graph errors propagate through graph-guided retrieval to the
  file choices and patches of Gemma 4 on tasks from the Gemma 4 Developer Agent Competition, with an
  edge-level corruption protocol, a run-time call tracer and a containerized test harness.
keywords:
  - software engineering
  - code localization
  - call graphs
  - robustness evaluation
  - coding agents
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ahnaf181419/graphtrustbench"
